<title>USA: BTR Plc unit gets $223.6-mln U.S. contract.</title>
<headline>BTR Plc unit gets $223.6-mln U.S. contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Power Conversion Inc of Elmwood Park, N.J., a unit of BTR Plc of Britain, has been awarded a $223.6 million U.S. defense contract for rectangular lithium batteries for use in various types of equipment, the Army said.</p>
</text>
